msgid "The installer runs in its own console window (about 10 GB, one time). When it finishes, come back and press Start ComfyUI."
msgstr "安装器会在自己的控制台窗口里跑（约 10 GB，只跑一次）。跑完回来点「启动 ComfyUI」。"

#: plugin/ai-inpaint/ai-inpaint.py
msgid "Installer not found next to the plug-in. Download setup-ai.bat + setup_ai.py from the plug-in pack (ai-setup folder)."
msgstr "插件旁边没找到安装器。请从插件包的 ai-setup 目录取 setup-ai.bat 和 setup_ai.py。"

