msgid "GIMP could not rasterise the vector layer \"%s\"."
msgstr "GIMP 没能把矢量图层「%s」渲染成位图。"

#: plugin/convert/convert.py
msgid "The vector layer \"%s\" renders to nothing; nothing to rasterise."
msgstr "矢量图层「%s」渲染出来是空的，没有可栅格化的内容。"

#: plugin/convert/convert.py
msgid "Vector layer \"%s\" rasterised into a pixel layer (its own fill and stroke, the vector layer is replaced)"
msgstr "矢量图层「%s」已按它自己的填充与描边栅格化为像素图层（原矢量图层被替换）"

#: plugin/convert/convert.py
msgid "Path \"%s\" rasterised into layer \"%s\" (filled with the foreground colour)"
msgstr "路径「%s」已栅格化为图层「%s」（用前景色填充）"

#: plugin/convert/convert.py
msgid "A vector layer (GIMP 3.2) is rasterised with its own fill and stroke and replaces that layer; a bare path becomes a new layer filled with the foreground colour."
msgstr "矢量图层（GIMP 3.2）按它自己的填充与描边渲染，并替换掉那一层；裸路径则新建一层，用前景色填充。"

#: plugin/convert/convert.py
msgid "Path to bitmap: a vector layer is rasterised as it looks and replaces itself; a bare path becomes a new layer filled with the foreground colour, cropped to the path."
msgstr "路径转位图：矢量图层按它显示的样子栅格化并替换自身；裸路径新建一层、用前景色填充，并裁到路径范围。"

